select 'aqa-8463-h-p2-mock1', s.id, 'Physics Higher Paper 2: Mock 1', 'AQA', 105, true, 100, 'You may use a calculator. Answer all the questions. Use g = 9.8 N/kg. Equations you are not expected to remember are given in the question; all other equations you need to recall. Show your working in calculations: you can get marks for method even if your final answer is wrong. Give units with your answers where they are not given. Questions marked 6 marks are extended answers: write in full sentences and organise your ideas. Diagrams and graphs are described in words; you can describe any diagram you would draw.'
